  pkNote="Prices are a guide for a standard room with the toilet and bath or shower staying in the same place. Moving a waste, a larger room or premium tiles will add to the price. Labour-only full refit, with your own suite, from £2,750."
  factsTitle="Bathroom fitting at a glance"
  facts={[
